  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Dynamic Programming on Broken Profile.",
      "source_hash": 12647360161146482729,
      "context_hash": 596016442045256711,
      "translation": "부러진 프로파일에 대한 동적 계획법.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dynamic programming": "동적 계획법"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636713Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Problem \"Parquet\"",
      "source_hash": 12758471390117033315,
      "context_hash": 17867121965503405864,
      "translation": "문제 \"Parquet\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Common problems solved using DP on broken profile include:",
      "source_hash": 15973635834035880733,
      "context_hash": 16158050856880221313,
      "translation": "부러진 프로파일 DP로 풀리는 대표적인 문제 유형은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "finding number of ways to fully fill an area (e.g. chessboard/grid) with some figures (e.g. dominoes)",
      "source_hash": 2216482597184941299,
      "context_hash": 1483957459355210999,
      "translation": "어떤 영역(예: 체스판/격자)을 일부 도형(예: 도미노)으로 완전히 채우는 방법의 수를 구하는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "finding a way to fill an area with minimum number of figures",
      "source_hash": 9690440845111212240,
      "context_hash": 18434380941554853359,
      "translation": "최소 개수의 도형으로 어떤 영역을 채우는 방법을 구하는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "finding a partial fill with minimum number of unfilled space (or cells, in case of grid)",
      "source_hash": 15529769020784757568,
      "context_hash": 5481559515792158234,
      "translation": "채워지지 않은 공간(격자의 경우 칸)이 최소가 되도록 부분적으로 채우는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "finding a partial fill with the minimum number of figures, such that no more figures can be added",
      "source_hash": 9406340589637357177,
      "context_hash": 1006900166562009385,
      "translation": "더 이상 도형을 추가할 수 없도록 최소 개수의 도형으로 부분적으로 채우는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Problem \"Parquet\"",
      "source_hash": 12758471390117033315,
      "context_hash": 15732655376900921031,
      "translation": "문제 \"Parquet\"",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Problem description.** Given a grid of size $N \\times M$.",
      "source_hash": 4858721943796912614,
      "context_hash": 5245090385303603116,
      "translation": "**문제 설명.** 크기가 $N \\times M$인 격자가 주어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Find number of ways to fill the grid with figures of size $2 \\times 1$ (no cell should be left unfilled, and figures should not overlap each other).",
      "source_hash": 7761915902867987474,
      "context_hash": 12381871481783015913,
      "translation": "크기가 $2 \\times 1$인 도형들로 격자를 채우는 방법의 수를 구하십시오(빈 칸이 남아서는 안 되며, 도형들은 서로 겹치지 않아야 합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Let the DP state be: $dp[i, mask]$, where $i = 1, \\ldots N$ and $mask = 0, \\ldots 2^M - 1$.",
      "source_hash": 7434651811211482330,
      "context_hash": 5148032303576642855,
      "translation": "DP 상태를 $dp[i, mask]$라고 합시다. 여기서 $i = 1, \\ldots N$이고 $mask = 0, \\ldots 2^M - 1$입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "$i$ represents number of rows in the current grid, and $mask$ is the state of last row of current grid.",
      "source_hash": 17701319732539115738,
      "context_hash": 7440773491949641963,
      "translation": "$i$는 현재 격자의 행 수를 나타내고, $mask$는 현재 격자의 마지막 행의 상태를 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If $j$-th bit of $mask$ is $0$ then the corresponding cell is filled, otherwise it is unfilled.",
      "source_hash": 10598202021671173311,
      "context_hash": 2024730094490050592,
      "translation": "$mask$의 $j$번째 비트가 $0$이면 해당 칸은 채워진 것이고, 그렇지 않으면 채워지지 않은 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Clearly, the answer to the problem will be $dp[N, 0]$.",
      "source_hash": 1797149503747693398,
      "context_hash": 12887219307847990094,
      "translation": "명백히, 이 문제의 답은 $dp[N, 0]$이 될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636715Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "We will be building the DP state by iterating over each $i = 1, \\cdots N$ and each $mask = 0, \\ldots 2^M - 1$, and for each $mask$ we will be only transitioning forward, that is, we will be _adding_ figures to the current grid.",
      "source_hash": 475448268700435700,
      "context_hash": 14400492425977395983,
      "translation": "우리는 각 $i = 1, \\cdots N$과 각 $mask = 0, \\ldots 2^M - 1$에 대해 순회하며 DP 상태를 구축할 것이며, 각 $mask$에 대해서는 오직 앞으로 전이만 할 것입니다. 즉, 현재 격자에 도형을 *추가*하는 방식입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636715Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 8947393247133454443,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:43:12.636715Z",
      "issues": []
    },
